WEBVTT

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:35.540
Hold on.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.500
You should ask me first

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.830
before taking on a task.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.040
What do you think?

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.620
Can we help?

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.450
What are these photos?

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:04.660
This suspect is cunning and seasoned,

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.200
his modus operandi
is extremely meticulous.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.200
This is the only surveillance photo
that managed to capture his image.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.370
What crime did he commit?

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.290
There have been frequent
homicides happening lately.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:16.500
There were no obvious motives
for these murders,

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.450
and there were no specific connections
among the victims.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:23.120
So we've deduced that
this is probably a serial homicide.

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:26.660
However, based on the clues
we have so far,

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:29.250
it seems that finding the killer
is not going to be that simple.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.200
What?

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.910
What an inhuman pervert!

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:34.040
Who are you talking about?

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.410
It is imperative that
we help with this case!

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:36.370
We have to catch him as soon as possible

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:37.910
to prevent someone else
from becoming a victim!

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:39.290
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:41.370
who gave you the right to speak for us?

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:43.000
Captain Xiao, don't listen to him.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.580
It's still up to Lu Guang
to decide whether or not we can help.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.370
I've looked at the general situation.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.290
I'm sorry,

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.410
but this time,

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.830
there's nothing we can do.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:55.000
Huh? Lu Guang, that's it?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.580
Did you see it clearly?

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.750
Come on, let's go!

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:06.370
Hey, Lu Guang,

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:07.540
did you look at the photos carefully?

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:08.870
Shut up.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.370
This is such a big case,
it's not a joke!

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.330
Anyway, I trust Lu Guang's judgment!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.040
Lu Guang,
are you sure you saw it clearly?

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:42.500
You rarely ever say no.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.870
Who was the one who
wanted to take a break?

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:46.870
Uh, I,

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.160
at the time,

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.620
I mean, but after that,

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.250
um, I just...

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.080
Come and receive guests!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.250
Welcome, my landlady...

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.660
Boss, welcome in!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:03.290
Hey, Xu Shanshan, why are you here
instead of studying?

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.290
Heh,

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:07.580
I'm here because I care about
the reemployment of the jobless.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:08.540
Oh my,

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.790
so you're here to observe
the regular people's life.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:11.910
It's no wonder,

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.370
after all, it's easy to grow out of touch
with society after studying so much,

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:15.750
I understand.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:18.790
I have no choice,

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.080
unlike certain people,

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.040
who has rely on others
to survive even after graduation.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.080
Mind your words,

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.620
who's relying on whom to survive?

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.540
Am I wrong?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:27.790
The house is provided by Qiao,

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.040
the business is managed by Lu Guang,

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.790
aren't you just a good-for-nothing?

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:31.950
We are partners!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.290
Don't poison the well if you don't
understand the situation clearly!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:36.000
You only look at the surface of things,

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.040
you have such low EQ!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.040
Quiet!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.540
What have I always told you?

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:43.620
We must be considerate and
attentive to our customers.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.830
What customers?

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:47.660
Unless...

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.540
Hmph, if it wasn't Qiao who convinced me
to come and give it a try,

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.450
I wouldn't even want to be here.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.040
Shanshan,

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.500
what do you need help with?

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:57.620
Well,

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.700
let me tell you about it!

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:00.870
To begin,

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.370
let us return to

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:03.830
our vigorous

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:06.450
university days.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.790
Do you still remember,

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:09.790
aside from the three of us,
there was another good friend

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.160
hanging around our beautiful Miss Xu?

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.410
Dong Yi.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.870
Fine, then,

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.660
but you'll have to help me take this.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.910
I'll come and get it from you at
your dormitory after I get back tonight.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:22.580
What time?

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:23.870
If the entrance of
the dormitory is locked,

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:25.620
I'll have to throw it down to you
from the window.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.830
The two of you are basically like
an old married couple,

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.830
why not clarify your relationship?

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:30.870
Pfft,

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:33.950
shouldn't boys take the initiative
in such matters?

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.370
Dong Yi,

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:39.290
over here!

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:41.950
Here, this is for you.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.330
Two fried eggs, slightly spicy,

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:46.290
one sausage, no coriander.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:47.830
Thanks, how much is it?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.620
I'll transfer the money to you via WeChat.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:50.870
Are you serious?

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.450
Talking about money hurts relationships.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.200
Let's talk about
other conditions, shall we?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.660
Uh...

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:01.870
Yes!

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:03.040
I've finally reached Platinum!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.500
My ranking is King,

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:09.040
it's more than enough to carry you.

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:11.330
Is there something growing in my brain?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.790
Why am I getting a headache
after just a few rounds?

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:14.790
What are you laughing at?

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.200
Hey, do you even have a conscience?

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.250
What if there's something
bad growing in my brain?

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:21.910
This problem is happening
to younger people nowadays.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.450
Haven't you heard?

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.040
What?

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:27.080
You and Dong Yi were actually...

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.620
...a couple?

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.250
Who's the one with the low EQ?

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.330
Alas, it's been so many years,

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.370
yet the secret's still not out.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.950
This is driving me crazy.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.040
What?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.370
Postgraduate?

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.120
Why are you so shocked?

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:42.950
I just want to further my studies,

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:45.450
which will give me a higher chance
of getting a better job in the future.

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:47.870
Beautiful Miss Xu,

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.040
for the next two years,

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.910
I won't be by your side,

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.540
so you'll have to
take good care of yourself.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.160
Hey, hey, give me a break.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.870
Who usually takes care of whom?

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:57.620
With you gone,
I can relax a lot more.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:00.830
Oh wow, so you've always hated
having to put up with me.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.700
But deep down in my heart I knew,

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:06.000
that she decided to stay behind
because of Dong Yi.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.950
That tutor is awful!

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:09.910
All he cares about
is his business outside.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.250
We hardly get to see him at all.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.200
Stop complaining about it,

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.450
we have to rely on ourselves then.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.450
The whole time,

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.200
she waited for the sentence
that never came.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.500
Like an arrow, time flew by,

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.410
in the blink of an eye,

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.040
two years of postgraduate studies
passed in a flash.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.750
Cheers!

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.830
We've graduated again!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.370
Yeah, after bachelor's degree,
it's master's,

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:31.660
after master's, it's doctorate,

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:32.790
let's continue studying!

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.040
Oh no, I'm done with studying,

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.290
I have to look for a job.

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:36.160
Take care of yourselves!

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.450
--I'll drink to that!
--Xu Shanshan,

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.000
--All good things must come to an end.
--take a photo with Dong Yi!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.250
Come here, why are you so shy?

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.160
Stop talking,
you're so old-fashioned.

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:47.450
Here, I only have
two photos from that night,

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:50.200
the other one is a selfie
I took for fun before dinner.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.790
Cheng Xiaoshi, you're so annoying.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.620
Why don't you tell us about
the specifics of the task first?

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.120
After that, I'll pick a suitable photo.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.290
Let me tell you the rest of the story.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.160
After the farewell dinner,
we went to a karaoke.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.580
It ended pretty late,

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.450
and somehow,

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:08.660
I drank a little too much.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:09.500
Oh?

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.120
And then...

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.040
Get lost,

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:13.200
it's not what you think it is!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:14.080
I'm leaving.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.410
--Bye-bye!
--See you guys next time.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:16.660
Hope you all get rich in the future!

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.700
Hey, let's keep in touch.

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.290
Of course!

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.250
Goodbye, my fellow classmates!

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:22.410
--Hey, Dong Yi,
--Hey, Xu Shanshan.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:23.040
--be careful.
--Let's keep in touch!

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.200
--Bye!
--Let's go, let's go.

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:24.870
--Sure!
--Keep in touch!

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:27.040
Don't go, no one is allowed to leave!

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.410
They're gone,

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:29.250
they're all already gone.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.290
Then you should join me
for another round!

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:32.700
The signal is pretty weak here,

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.160
I can't get a ride,

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.080
I'll go over to that side and try.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.870
All of them can leave,

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.410
except for you,
you're not allowed to go anywhere!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.540
Xu Shanshan,

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.290
I have something to tell you.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:52.330
Ugh!

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.620
At the time, I blacked out,

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:56.750
I didn't hear a single word he said.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.450
After sobering up, I realised I had
done lots of embarrassing things,

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:00.410
and got myself in trouble,

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.160
I regret it so much!

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:04.660
If you care so much about what he said,

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.660
why didn't you just ask him
about it afterward?

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:08.450
It's because I care so much,

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:10.790
that's why I couldn't bring myself to ask.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:14.040
I'm so afraid that the answer
is not going to be what I think it is.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.200
Pfft, how dramatic.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:20.910
Got it,

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.750
we can help you with this.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:23.580
What?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.660
You agree, just like that?

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:25.790
Hey wait a minute,

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.500
did you say help?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.620
This is clearly a deal,
why should we do it for free?

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:33.080
She should at least give us
a little something in return.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.660
Cheng Xiaoshi! You traitor!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.450
I'm just trying to pay off your debt.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.250
Hey, if you're willing to give
a discount, that's fine as well.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:41.700
Not my face!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:46.410
Hmph, it seems his brain
can't function properly

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:47.540
without a beating a day.

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.040
Hey Qiao,

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.660
how are they able to
get information of the past from photos?

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:55.290
Hmm, I don't know exactly.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.200
They always do it alone every time,

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.450
it's very mysterious.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:02.120
I can't really trust Cheng Xiaoshi.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.290
I wonder if he'll do
anything questionable.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.000
Is there no justice in this world?

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.040
How could you beat up the person
who's going to help you?

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:12.080
I... Hmm,
I... realized something.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:15.250
Don't worry about it.

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:16.910
I think it's mainly Lu Guang's effort,

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.830
Cheng Xiaoshi is just a tool.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.660
Lu Guang being reliable is good enough.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:25.000
Cheng Xiaoshi,
what are you doing?

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.540
I just realized,

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:29.870
after entering the photo,

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:32.040
what I say, goes.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:35.200
I can do whatever I want.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.040
Xu Shanshan,

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:41.040
there are two internship positions
at my mom's hospital.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.370
If we date,

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.410
she said that she could
arrange a position for you.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:49.870
But, she doesn't really like
girls with long hair...

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:50.700
Huh?

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:52.120
What did you say?

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:56.660
Xu Shanshan,
you're going too far!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.870
Even if you want to reject me,
you shouldn't ruin yourself like this!

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.040
Huh?

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:03.790
It was just a joke,
why is he having a breakdown?

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:05.250
That boy looked quite tough,

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:06.330
why is his heart so fragile?

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.330
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:08.750
be careful with your current identity,

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.250
don't get Xu Shanshan in trouble.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:12.450
Do you want me to reiterate
the three rules we agreed on?

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:14.910
No, don't start chanting
your cursed incantation.

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:15.750
Xu Shanshan.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:16.910
Hmm?

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:20.370
It seems there's no one sitting here?

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.540
This feeling... is here again,

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.660
and her heart is beating
so much faster than before.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.450
My chest feels so uncomfortable!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.160
Pay attention
to where you put your hand.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.250
No one,

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.620
you don't need to be so polite with me.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:33.830
It's that temper of yours.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.660
I'm afraid that if I don't ask you first,
you'd hit me till I run away.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:38.910
Xu Shanshan,
take a photo with Dong Yi!

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.290
Come.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:41.250
Come here.

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.410
Why are you so shy?

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.910
You lose! is here again,

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.200
Again! Again! Again!

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:53.500
Xu Shanshan,

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.620
it's been so many years, yet none of us
have heard you sing before,

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:56.700
why don't you sing a song today?

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:57.660
Pick any song,

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:58.950
I can sing anything!

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.370
Wow!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.910
Hey, you're usually quite restrained,

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.040
but you're a little strange today.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.450
This heartbeat is making me
so uncomfortable, I can't not drink.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.040
Cheng Xiaoshi,
later you'll be drinking a bit too much.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.160
After you come back, remember to go
downstairs and sleep on the couch.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.080
Got it.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.500
No wonder Xu Shanshan got drunk.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.160
Hey, that's enough.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.750
It doesn't seem like you have
anything to worry about,

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.160
I don't think you need to drink
to ease your sorrows, right?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:23.580
You nerd, why are you always so rational?

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:26.330
Can't you follow your heart,
at least once?

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:30.870
Do you know why I chose
to further study back then?

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.250
No.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:39.370
Because in our four years of university,
I've already gotten so used to it.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.330
I've gotten used to having meals with you,

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:43.080
going to class with you,

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:45.410
playing games together,

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:48.870
taking walks aimlessly around the campus,

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:52.120
speaking thoughtless words
that we both understand.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.040
So,

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.660
further studying had become
a means for me to escape,

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.250
but now,

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.830
I still have to choose
to leave eventually.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.040
Leave?

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:03.580
It's because I care so much,

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:05.700
that's why I couldn't bring myself to ask.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:09.200
I'm so afraid that the answer
is not going to be what I think it is.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:13.120
Hey, Xu Shanshan,
the song we picked for you is here!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.500
Here, take the mic.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.250
That's amazing!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.910
Hey, what's wrong with you guys?

00:13:57.910 --> 00:13:59.750
Are you trying to trick me?

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.290
Hey, can you use your brain a little?

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.620
Why do you always start without
waiting for everyone to be ready?

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.290
I saw a good opportunity
to take down the enemy,

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:07.700
you guys are just slow!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.540
Can you three look a little lively?

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:11.040
You look like three joss
sticks stuck in an urn,

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.330
where's the fun in that?

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:14.950
Hey, let me see if

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.450
you ruined my handsome face

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.290
with a blurry photo.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.660
--Go away.
--Remember to come back often!

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:22.620
It wasn't easy to pass
the oral defense, stop cursing me.

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:23.660
Dong Yi,

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:26.040
from now on it's up to you
to take care of our beautiful Miss Xu.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:39.540
Hey, don't you think
it's such a coincidence that

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:40.750
the both of us decided to further study?

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.040
Is it a coincidence?

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.200
I don't know,

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:45.450
there's so many of us who stayed
behind to further study after all.

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:46.700
You're no fun.

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:51.370
Tomorrow morning's class
is still at Yi Fu Building 201,

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.040
don't forget our usual.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.040
I got it,

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.450
two fried eggs, slightly spicy,

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.580
one sausage, no coriander.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.040
If it's possible,

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.660
I never want to say goodbye.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.620
You sound so good.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:12.120
You can really sing!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.250
Xu Shanshan,

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.410
I can't believe that
after six years of friendship,

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:16.790
I never realized that
you could sing so well.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:19.160
That was pretty good,
your breathing was quite stable.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:22.000
Whenever he speaks,
her heart beats like crazy,

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.370
I think the only way is to...

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.040
Keep drinking!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.450
My fellow brothers and sisters,

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.120
let's keep singing!

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:34.370
Bye-bye!

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.250
See you guys next time.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:36.580
Hope you all get rich in the future!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.700
Hey, let's keep in touch.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.160
Of course!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.290
Goodbye, my fellow classmates!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.200
--Hey, Dong Yi,
--Hey, Xu Shanshan.

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:43.200
--be careful.
--Let's keep in touch!

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.040
--Bye!
--Sure!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.120
Don't go, no one is allowed to leave!

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:48.160
They're gone,

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.330
they're all already gone.

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:51.410
Then you should join me
for another round!

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:52.790
The signal is pretty weak here,

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.660
I can't get a ride,

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.370
I'll go over to that side and try.

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.120
All of them can leave,

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.580
except for you,
you're not allowed to go anywhere!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.160
So far so good.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.160
Just a little more and we're finished.

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:14.040
Xu Shanshan,

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.500
I have something to tell you.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.370
This person is so sneaky,

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.160
why does he look so familiar?

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:30.000
It's the serial killer from the photo!

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:38.040
Hey.

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:39.040
Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.000
Hey.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.870
I can't let him get away.

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:52.250
Xu Shanshan, are you sober now?

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:54.580
Damn it, my head is still dizzy.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.330
Hey, why are you going there?

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:17.040
Cheng Xiaoshi,
have you lost your mind?

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:20.160
I just saw the suspect
from the surveillance photo.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:21.250
Don't be foolish,

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:23.370
you can't catch him on your own.

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:25.500
Furthermore,

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:28.410
this guy is more trouble
than human traffickers.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.620
But I can take a photo of his face,
at least it could serve as another clue

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.750
to help the police
resolve the case earlier.

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:41.000
Oh no, where's my phone?

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.540
Watch out, behind you!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.660
Wait!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.120
If you turn around suddenly,

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.160
you might trigger the suspect.

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.750
It might cause him to attack even quicker.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:52.830
Then what am I supposed to do now?

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:56.080
Try to create a situation where
he wouldn't be able to attack,

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.250
then wait for an opportunity.

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:59.120
Can't attack, then...

00:17:59.120 --> 00:17:59.950
Oh no,

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:02.200
I drank too much, I need to pee,

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:05.410
like a waterfall...

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.290
...streaming down...

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:11.450
Damn it, I forgot I'm a girl now...

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.200
Hurry and find another way!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.830
Does he still intend to attack me
when I'm like this?

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.660
He truly is a pervert!

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.080
I'm just going to go for it!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:36.120
Oh no, it's for real now!

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:49.830
The danger has been eliminated.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.540
Where did he go?

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:55.750
No!

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:56.950
Take this!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.000
It's me!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.000
When did you learn self defense?

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.160
Dong Yi?

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:04.790
Where's the guy with the baseball cap?

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.950
Isn't this the mama's boy...

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:23.040
It's just a case of unrequited love
from a male classmate

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.370
who had the wrong intentions,

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:27.950
how did it get so exaggerated
and turned into a resolved urban mystery?

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.910
Does this bunch of unscrupulous media
have any bottom line?

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:34.250
Not only did they come up with
some baseless and exaggerated headline,

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.660
they even published her photo!

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:39.040
How's the task going?

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.500
I got distracted with catching a suspect.

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.040
I've written everything down.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.450
Sure enough, Lu Guang is always reliable.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.040
Oh right, I almost forgot
you had this ability.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.790
So, what exactly did
Dong Yi say back then?

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.950
I've already passed
his message to Shanshan.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:54.660
Xu Shanshan,

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.450
I have something to tell you.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.290
When we were getting ready to graduate,

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:01.040
my parents had urged me to go back.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:04.790
My dad has arranged everything for me,

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.620
so I've known all along
that after I graduate,

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:08.450
it's impossible for me
to stay in this city.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:09.620
Dong Yi!

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.250
I never dared to confess my feelings...

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.700
What are you worrying about?

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.370
...because

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:19.160
I was afraid of hurting you, who had
stayed by my side for six years.

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.450
Oh, I'm just worrying
about the oral defense.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.910
Hey, what's the big deal?

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:26.290
I'm meeting with Qiao Ling tonight
to watch a movie and relax,

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:27.410
do you want to come along?

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.660
That's all right,
I have some things to finish up.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:30.870
Fine, then,

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.540
but you'll have to help me take this.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.950
I'll come and get it from you at your
dormitory after I get back tonight.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:37.870
What time?

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.080
If the entrance of
the dormitory is locked,

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.040
I'll have to throw it down to you
from the window.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:43.040
The two of you are basically like
an old married couple,

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.500
why not clarify your relationship?

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.330
Now that I have to graduate,

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:50.040
I've finally realized,

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.790
no matter how hard the future may be,

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.870
I want to stay.

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:57.040
Because leaving you

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:59.040
hurts more than anything else.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:00.040
Tomorrow morning at ten,

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.040
he has an important interview
at the Union Building,

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.040
and he hopes that you can accompany him.

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:07.370
It's obvious he's asking Shanshan
to make her feelings clear!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.540
Let me ask her
if she went this morning.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:18.540
Hehe,

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.330
so did you accompany him
to his interview this morning?

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:23.450
Wow, what a quick reply,

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:25.910
it seems everything went smoothly.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.500
Hey, Dong Yi.

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:32.950
You're here to interview
for this company as well?

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:34.120
It's almost ten o'clock,

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.910
what are you doing standing around?

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:38.250
Oh, I'll go up in a moment.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:39.620
Then I'll head up first.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:52.410
Did the things I said that day
make her angry?

00:21:58.040 --> 00:21:59.370
Hmm?

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:01.950
Shanshan, what is this?

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:07.910
Qiao Ling,

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:09.830
call Xu Shanshan and ask.

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:11.080
Ah, okay.

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:24.160
Xu Shanshan,

00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:26.580
were you the one who sent
that message in the group?

00:22:32.290 --> 00:22:33.870
I will...

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:37.450
...show up as promised.
